	(text "Root sheet. Signal flow: Power -> Front End -> Slicer/LVDS -> Connector; Detector and Control close the AGC/threshold loop; the Controller (ESP32-C6, decision 11)\nsets gain/threshold/HV, monitors HV/LOS and talks CAN to the headstage through the Connector. Status labels: VERIFIED / PROPOSED / UNRESOLVED.\nNo part values are approved for fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6954c36b-f52f-4bb7-aade-8ee400b0074e")
	)
	(text "Power rails +5V, 3V3, 3V3_D, +3V7, -3V7, 5V_A are carried as hierarchical sheet pins (joined on this sheet by local labels).\nGND is a global net: each sub-sheet carries a global label GND (no sheet pin)."
